{"id":"d0648d6c0cc0fcf3","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-image-functoriality.md","title":"Theorem — 像分解对交换方块的唯一诱导箭头","display":"Theorem — 像分解对交换方块的唯一诱导箭头","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-image-functoriality","aliases":["14-thm-image-functoriality"],"display":"Theorem — 像分解对交换方块的唯一诱导箭头","depends_on":["[[14-thm-pushout-image]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]"],"source_ref":"IV.6 Proposition 2 and proof, printed 185–186; DjVu 98–99","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-image-functoriality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-image-functoriality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 像分解对交换方块的唯一诱导箭头"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8d0caa944c37be9\" href=\"?note=b8d0caa944c37be9\" title=\"14-thm-pushout-image\">14-thm-pushout-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.6 Proposition 2 and proof, printed 185–186; DjVu 98–99"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是初等拓扑斯。固定本书集合宇宙中的一组满/单分解数据 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=m_fe_f\">\\(f=m_fe_f\\)</span>，其中对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_f=\\mathrm{dom}(f)\">\\(A_f=\\mathrm{dom}(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_f=\\mathrm{cod}(f)\">\\(B_f=\\mathrm{cod}(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_f:A_f\\to I_f\">\\(e_f:A_f\\to I_f\\)</span> 满、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_f:I_f\\hookrightarrow B_f\">\\(m_f:I_f\\hookrightarrow B_f\\)</span> 单。这样的选择由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b8d0caa944c37be9\" href=\"?note=b8d0caa944c37be9\" title=\"14-thm-pushout-image\">14-thm-pushout-image</a>给出，选择只在本书的集合宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中进行。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsImageMono}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsImageMono}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b8d0caa944c37be9\" href=\"?note=b8d0caa944c37be9\" title=\"14-thm-pushout-image\">14-thm-pushout-image</a>；不把“满/单分解”预先等同于该最小性谓词。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,h\">\\(f,g,h\\)</span> 遍历环境箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{f,g}\">\\(D_{f,g}\\)</span> 是下式新构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a&#39;,b&#39;)\">\\((a&#39;,b&#39;)\\)</span> 是相应交换方块的输入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsIso}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a>，所有同构、复合和恒等均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A_f,A_g)\\times\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B_f,B_g)\\mid b\\circ f=g\\circ a\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A_f,A_g)\\times\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B_f,B_g)\\mid b\\circ f=g\\circ a\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\quad\\mathrm{IsImageMono}_{\\mathcal E}(f,m_f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\quad\\mathrm{IsImageMono}_{\\mathcal E}(f,m_f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nD_{f,g}:\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\to\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I_f,I_g),\\\\\n\\forall(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\quad\\exists!s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I_f,I_g)\\ (s\\circ e_f=e_g\\circ a\\land m_g\\circ s=b\\circ m_f),\\\\\nD_{f,g}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I_f,I_g)\\quad\n(s\\circ e_f=e_g\\circ a\\land m_g\\circ s=b\\circ m_f),\\\\\nD_{f,f}(1_{A_f},1_{B_f})=1_{I_f},\\\\\n\\forall(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\ \\forall(a&#39;,b&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(g,h)\\quad\nD_{g,h}(a&#39;,b&#39;)\\circ D_{f,g}(a,b)=D_{f,h}(a&#39;\\circ a,b&#39;\\circ b),\\\\\n\\forall(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\quad\n(\\mathrm{IsIso}(a)\\land\\mathrm{IsIso}(b)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsIso}(D_{f,g}(a,b))).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nD_{f,g}:\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\to\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I_f,I_g),\\\\\n\\forall(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\quad\\exists!s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I_f,I_g)\\ (s\\circ e_f=e_g\\circ a\\land m_g\\circ s=b\\circ m_f),\\\\\nD_{f,g}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I_f,I_g)\\quad\n(s\\circ e_f=e_g\\circ a\\land m_g\\circ s=b\\circ m_f),\\\\\nD_{f,f}(1_{A_f},1_{B_f})=1_{I_f},\\\\\n\\forall(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\ \\forall(a&#39;,b&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(g,h)\\quad\nD_{g,h}(a&#39;,b&#39;)\\circ D_{f,g}(a,b)=D_{f,h}(a&#39;\\circ a,b&#39;\\circ b),\\\\\n\\forall(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\quad\n(\\mathrm{IsIso}(a)\\land\\mathrm{IsIso}(b)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsIso}(D_{f,g}(a,b))).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>原书 IV.6 Proposition 2（印刷185–186页，DjVu98–99）给像分解对箭头方块的函子性；原稿记录曾读本地 OCR 的陈述与证明。本条给出实际输入集合、唯一描述映射及恒等/复合方程，没有重复<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a>的“正则性”总断言。</p>\n<p>先说明任意所选满/单分解确有最小性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=kg\">\\(f=kg\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k:J\\hookrightarrow B_f\">\\(k:J\\hookrightarrow B_f\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_km_fe_f=\\chi_kf=\\top!_{A_f}=(\\top!_{B_f}m_f)e_f\">\\(\\chi_km_fe_f=\\chi_kf=\\top!_{A_f}=(\\top!_{B_f}m_f)e_f\\)</span>。消去满态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_f\">\\(e_f\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_km_f=\\top!_{I_f}\">\\(\\chi_km_f=\\top!_{I_f}\\)</span>；分类子拉回给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_f\">\\(m_f\\)</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的唯一因子。因此它满足<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b8d0caa944c37be9\" href=\"?note=b8d0caa944c37be9\" title=\"14-thm-pushout-image\">14-thm-pushout-image</a>的像谓词。</p>\n<p>给交换方块 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_g:I_g\\hookrightarrow B_g\">\\(m_g:I_g\\hookrightarrow B_g\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:B_f\\to B_g\">\\(b:B_f\\to B_g\\)</span> 拉回，得到单态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:P\\hookrightarrow B_f\">\\(p:P\\hookrightarrow B_f\\)</span>。因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bf=ga=m_ge_ga\">\\(bf=ga=m_ge_ga\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 因子化。刚证明的最小性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_f\">\\(m_f\\)</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 因子化，再投影到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_g\">\\(I_g\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_gs=bm_f\">\\(m_gs=bm_f\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_gse_f=bm_fe_f=bf=ga=m_ge_ga\">\\(m_gse_f=bm_fe_f=bf=ga=m_ge_ga\\)</span>，消去 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_g\">\\(m_g\\)</span> 得另一个方程。任何满足右方程的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 都由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_g\">\\(m_g\\)</span> 的单态性唯一决定，所以唯一描述全定义且单值。</p>\n<p>恒等箭头满足恒等方块的两式，复合的两个诱导箭头满足合成方块的两式；唯一性给出所列方程。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 可逆，其逆组成反向交换方块；对两种复合用刚证明的恒等/复合律，得到诱导箭头互逆。特别地，给同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 选择两组满/单分解时，以源靶恒等方块得到唯一相容同构。这样像构造既不依赖未经声明的“arrow category”，也不要求像代表在不同选择下字面相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-pushout-image","status":"resolved","id":"b8d0caa944c37be9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-pushout-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-pushout-image","status":"resolved","id":"b8d0caa944c37be9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯。固定本书集合宇宙中的一组满/单分解数据 $f=m_fe_f$，其中对每个 $f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)$，$A_f=\\mathrm{dom}(f)$、$B_f=\\mathrm{cod}(f)$，$e_f:A_f\\to I_f$ 满、$m_f:I_f\\hookrightarrow B_f$ 单。这样的选择由[[14-thm-pushout-image]]给出，选择只在本书的集合宇宙 $\\mathcal V$ 中进行。$\\mathrm{IsImageMono}_{\\mathcal E}$ 采用 [[14-thm-pushout-image]]；不把“满/单分解”预先等同于该最小性谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-pushout-image","status":"resolved","id":"b8d0caa944c37be9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯。固定本书集合宇宙中的一组满/单分解数据 $f=m_fe_f$，其中对每个 $f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)$，$A_f=\\mathrm{dom}(f)$、$B_f=\\mathrm{cod}(f)$，$e_f:A_f\\to I_f$ 满、$m_f:I_f\\hookrightarrow B_f$ 单。这样的选择由[[14-thm-pushout-image]]给出，选择只在本书的集合宇宙 $\\mathcal V$ 中进行。$\\mathrm{IsImageMono}_{\\mathcal E}$ 采用 [[14-thm-pushout-image]]；不把“满/单分解”预先等同于该最小性谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g,h$ 遍历环境箭头。$\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)$ 及 $D_{f,g}$ 是下式新构造；$(a,b)$、$(a',b')$ 是相应交换方块的输入。$\\mathrm{IsIso}$ 使用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]，所有同构、复合和恒等均在 $\\mathcal E$ 中。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 IV.6 Proposition 2（印刷185–186页，DjVu98–99）给像分解对箭头方块的函子性；原稿记录曾读本地 OCR 的陈述与证明。本条给出实际输入集合、唯一描述映射及恒等/复合方程，没有重复[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]的“正则性”总断言。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-pushout-image","status":"resolved","id":"b8d0caa944c37be9","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"先说明任意所选满/单分解确有最小性。若 $f=kg$ 且 $k:J\\hookrightarrow B_f$，则 $\\chi_km_fe_f=\\chi_kf=\\top!_{A_f}=(\\top!_{B_f}m_f)e_f$。消去满态射 $e_f$ 得 $\\chi_km_f=\\top!_{I_f}$；分类子拉回给 $m_f$ 经 $k$ 的唯一因子。因此它满足[[14-thm-pushout-image]]的像谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"f=m_fe_f","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"A_f=\\mathrm{dom}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"B_f=\\mathrm{cod}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"e_f:A_f\\to I_f","display":false},{"tex":"m_f:I_f\\hookrightarrow B_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsImageMono}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"f,g,h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)","display":false},{"tex":"D_{f,g}","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"(a',b')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsIso}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A_f,A_g)\\times\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B_f,B_g)\\mid b\\circ f=g\\circ a\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\quad\\mathrm{IsImageMono}_{\\mathcal E}(f,m_f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nD_{f,g}:\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\to\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I_f,I_g),\\\\\n\\forall(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\quad\\exists!s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I_f,I_g)\\ (s\\circ e_f=e_g\\circ a\\land m_g\\circ s=b\\circ m_f),\\\\\nD_{f,g}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I_f,I_g)\\quad\n(s\\circ e_f=e_g\\circ a\\land m_g\\circ s=b\\circ m_f),\\\\\nD_{f,f}(1_{A_f},1_{B_f})=1_{I_f},\\\\\n\\forall(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\ \\forall(a',b')\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(g,h)\\quad\nD_{g,h}(a',b')\\circ D_{f,g}(a,b)=D_{f,h}(a'\\circ a,b'\\circ b),\\\\\n\\forall(a,b)\\in\\mathrm{Sq}_{\\mathcal E}(f,g)\\quad\n(\\mathrm{IsIso}(a)\\land\\mathrm{IsIso}(b)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsIso}(D_{f,g}(a,b))).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"f=kg","display":false},{"tex":"k:J\\hookrightarrow B_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_km_fe_f=\\chi_kf=\\top!_{A_f}=(\\top!_{B_f}m_f)e_f","display":false},{"tex":"e_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_km_f=\\top!_{I_f}","display":false},{"tex":"m_f","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"m_g:I_g\\hookrightarrow B_g","display":false},{"tex":"b:B_f\\to B_g","display":false},{"tex":"p:P\\hookrightarrow B_f","display":false},{"tex":"bf=ga=m_ge_ga","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"m_f","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"I_g","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"m_gs=bm_f","display":false},{"tex":"m_gse_f=bm_fe_f=bf=ga=m_ge_ga","display":false},{"tex":"m_g","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"m_g","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":4227,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-image-functoriality|Theorem — 像分解对交换方块的唯一诱导箭头]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-image-functoriality]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-image-functoriality]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-image-functoriality]]"},{"id":"a847472bc37dd64a","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-image-functoriality]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-image-functoriality|Theorem — 像分解对交换方块的唯一诱导箭头]]"},{"id":"b8d0caa944c37be9","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"把已完成的同一最小像构造应用于 $e:A\\to I$，得 $e=ne_0$，$n:J\\hookrightarrow I$ 是其最小单因子。于是 $f=mn e_0$，最小性给 $v:I\\to J$ 满足 $mnv=m$。消去单态射 $m$ 得 $nv=1_I$；再消去 $n$ 得 $vn=1_J$。所以 $n$ 同构，由上一段得到 $e$ 满。这里先证明所有箭头的最小单因子，再推满性，并未循环预用[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]的正则像分解。所得单态射类与[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]的 $\\mathrm{Im}(f)$ 对应，后续[[14-thm-image-functoriality]]把任何满/单分解之间的比较补全。"},{"id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"具体自推出—等化子的最小像构造及其满性证明见 [[14-thm-pushout-image]]；交换方块上的唯一诱导箭头、恒等与复合律见 [[14-thm-image-functoriality]]。这两项展开本条像构造部分，不替代本条另行复用的正则满态射拉回稳定性结果。"}],"outgoing":["b8d0caa944c37be9","a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","199dc3cf97e92fa1","d5f547b903550705","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","4cd3b0d29b80beda"]}